I am proud to have served 50 years in public office and deeply grateful to each and every staff member, fellow lawmaker, and community advocate for joining me to protect and expand fundamental rights for all, and to hold those in power accountable to our democracy. 

@MicahLasher, thank you for this thoughtful retrospective. It has been an honor working with you over the past few decades, and I look forward to continuing to watch you serve our community. 

